# Config

Every setting `daedalus config` can read or write, shown with where its value
comes from. Layers: D default → U user (~/.config/daedalus) → P project
(.daedalus/config.json). Writes go through the same library as the CLI.

@browse
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Config                                                                                  esc back │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ sources.ado ▾   [all] · changed only · search /                                                  │
├──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┤
│ user                     │  organization           org       P         │ on_conflict             │
│ git                      │▸ on_conflict            propose   P         │                         │
│ ariadne                  │  sync_interval          15m       U         │ When ADO and the        │
│ edicts                   │  write_back             ask       D         │ gameplan disagree.      │
│ doctor                   │  credentials            keyring ✓ U         │                         │
│ hooks                    │                                             │ propose · source ·      │
│ board                    │                                             │ local                   │
│ reconstruct              │                                             │                         │
│▸sources.ado              │                                             │ D propose → P propose   │
│ tui                      │                                             │                         │
├──────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────┤
│ ◆KeyBar                                                                                          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: groups → keys → detail. The letter after a value says which layer set it.

## ◆EditSetting

@modal
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ sources.ado.on_conflict                     esc cancel │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                        │
│ When ADO and the gameplan disagree:                    │
│                                                        │
│ ( ) source   ADO wins, the gameplan is overwritten     │
│ (•) propose  the difference becomes a pending          │
│              proposal (default)                        │
│ ( ) local    the gameplan wins; ADO is left alone      │
│                                                        │
│ Save to:  [project]  user                              │
│                                                        │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ←/→ layer · enter save · x reset to inherited          │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: choices come from the setting's schema. Every key carries a description
(it is its Explain card), a type, and a default.

@secret
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ sources.ado.credentials                     esc cancel │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                        │
│ Personal access token for dev.azure.com/org            │
│                                                        │
│ Stored in: system keyring  ✓ set                       │
│                                                        │
│ r replace · d delete                                   │
│                                                        │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ never shown, never written to a config file            │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
